{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOVu7ZDrjnxyGDy2II08","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to set up a design in the empty workspace and then work through the build plan step by step. Let me start with the substantive pieces.\n\nThe workspace is empty. Assets are components with image fills, and the icons are vectors with white fill, which means I can recolor them. My plan is to build the design inside the workspace page. The assets live as components inside the reference pages, and cross-page instances work in Figma, so `createInstance()` across pages is fine.\n\nI write a large JS build script in use_figma, but each call caps at 50000 characters, so I structure the work in multiple calls: first the component library (buttons, headers, tab bar), then the frames. To keep it manageable, I skip a sprawling component library and build screens with local components for the repeated parts: ProfileHeader, MediaGridItem, StoryAvatar, FeedPost, TabBar, Header. The brief requires component reuse, so I build a small set of real Figma components.\n\nColors: brand plum #4B164C, orchid #DD88CF. Neutrals: ink #1A1A1F, secondary #6E6A75, border #ECE8EF, background #FFFFFF, surface soft #FBF7FB, tint lavender #F6EAF4. The gradient accent runs linear #4B164C → #DD88CF for the primary sign-in CTA and the like action. Type is Inter.\n\nEach screen is 393×852. 01_Welcome: white background, a decorative portrait collage with heart, Portrait_Sarah_Payne large in the center at rounded 32, the other portraits as circles, headline \"Let's meet new people around you\" at 30/ExtraBold, then Continue with Facebook, Continue with Google, \"Use mobile number\" (the given Button component, plum), and \"Don't have an account?\" alongside Sign Up.\n\n02_Apple_ID_Sheet: 01_Welcome dimmed behind, an iOS sheet from the bottom with Logo_Meet, \"Apple ID\", the copy, a Face ID button, and a close X. 03_Explore: header Explore plus bell, a stories row (Your Story plus 8) with an add plus, feed posts from Noemi, Yu Jian, and Maddison, Tab bar with Home current. 04_Find_Partner: header back plus \"Find your partner\", a card stack with John on top, gradient overlay at the bottom carrying name, age, location, distance, and an Active Now badge, 5 cards behind, action buttons for pass, star, and heart, tab bar with Dating current.\n\n05_Friend_Profile: header back, \"Claire Smith\", more, a portrait avatar, name, 63K Followers, Follow and Message buttons, tabs Top/Recent/Short with Top current, and a 3-column media grid from Claire_01 through Claire_09 with play icons on 01 and 09. 06_Short_Video: full-screen Short_Yu_Jian_Shore with a dark gradient overlay, header back, \"Short\", camera, a right rail for heart 123, chat 89, send, more, bottom-left author plus follow, caption, liked by, music, the \"4 people\" icon, and a tab bar overlay with Home current.\n\n07_Profile: header menu plus \"Sarah Payne\", profile avatar Sarah, name, 103K Followers, Edit Profile and Share Profile, tabs, and a grid Sarah_01 through Sarah_09. 08_Menu: a drawer over 07_Profile with the dimmed profile behind, white drawer, logo, an account row with avatar, name, Show Profile, and close, then the menu rows in source order (Setting, Your Activity, Archive, Saved, Close Friends, Favorites, Group profiles, Discover people).\n\nPrototype connections: 01 Sign Up → 02, 02 Face ID → 03, close → 01, 03 Claire story → 05, Dating tab → 04, Profile tab → 07, 04 back/Home → 03, Profile tab → 07, 05 back → 03, Short","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":32391,"input_tokens":1,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":32391}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b734eca0-483d-4488-a7f2-93add0cb